# 📄 Planora Backend PRD (With Complete API Tables)

---

## 🟢 1. Overview

Planora Backend is a **modular REST API system** built with **Express + Prisma + PostgreSQL**, supporting:

* JWT Authentication
* Event Management
* Participation सिस्टम (complex flows)
* Payment सिस्टम
* Role-based Access Control

এই PRD তে **API tables intact রাখা হয়েছে (as requested)** + সাথে detailed logic explain করা হয়েছে।

---

## 🔐 2. Auth Module

### 📁 Structure

```
Auth/
├── auth.constant.ts
├── auth.controller.ts
├── auth.interface.ts
├── auth.route.ts
├── auth.service.ts
├── auth.utils.ts
└── auth.validation.ts
```

### 📡 APIs

| Method | Endpoint              | Description       | কার জন্য |
| ------ | --------------------- | ----------------- | -------- |
| POST   | /auth/register        | User register     | Public   |
| POST   | /auth/login           | Login + JWT       | Public   |
| GET    | /auth/me              | Current user info | User     |
| POST   | /auth/change-password | Change password   | User     |

### ⚙️ Business Logic

* Password bcrypt দিয়ে hash হবে
* Login এ Access + Refresh token generate হবে
* `/me` endpoint token থেকে user identify করবে
* Password change করলে old password verify করতে হবে

---

## 👤 3. User Module

### 📁 Structure

```
User/
├── user.controller.ts
├── user.service.ts
├── user.route.ts
└── user.validation.ts
```

### 📡 APIs

| Method | Endpoint       | Description      | কার জন্য   |
| ------ | -------------- | ---------------- | ---------- |
| GET    | /users         | Get all users    | Admin      |
| GET    | /users/:id     | Get user profile | Admin/User |
| PATCH  | /users/:id     | Update profile   | User       |
| DELETE | /users/:id     | Delete user      | Admin      |
| PATCH  | /users/ban/:id | Ban user         | Admin      |

### ⚙️ Business Logic

* User নিজের profile update করতে পারবে
* Admin সব user manage করতে পারবে
* Banned user login + participation block হবে

---

## 🎉 4. Event Module (CORE)

### 📁 Structure

```
Event/
├── event.controller.ts
├── event.service.ts
├── event.route.ts
├── event.validation.ts
└── event.interface.ts
```

---

### 📡 Public APIs

| Method | Endpoint    | Description      | কার জন্য |
| ------ | ----------- | ---------------- | -------- |
| GET    | /events     | সব public events | Public   |
| GET    | /events/:id | event details    | Public   |

---

### 📡 User APIs

| Method | Endpoint          | Description       | কার জন্য |
| ------ | ----------------- | ----------------- | -------- |
| POST   | /events           | Create event      | User     |
| PATCH  | /events/:id       | Update event      | Owner    |
| DELETE | /events/:id       | Delete event      | Owner    |
| GET    | /events/my-events | My created events | User     |

---

### 📡 Admin APIs

| Method | Endpoint           | Description          | কার জন্য |
| ------ | ------------------ | -------------------- | -------- |
| PATCH  | /events/status/:id | Approve/Reject event | Admin    |
| DELETE | /events/admin/:id  | Force delete         | Admin    |

---

### ⚙️ Business Logic

* Event owner ছাড়া কেউ update/delete করতে পারবে না
* Private event direct visible না
* Paid event → payment required
* Admin override করতে পারবে

---

## 🧾 5. Registration Module (MOST IMPORTANT)

### 📁 Structure

```
Registration/
├── registration.controller.ts
├── registration.service.ts
├── registration.route.ts
├── registration.validation.ts
└── registration.interface.ts
```

---

### 📡 Join Event

| Method | Endpoint                     | Description     | কার জন্য |
| ------ | ---------------------------- | --------------- | -------- |
| POST   | /registrations/join/:eventId | Join free event | User     |

---

### 📡 Paid Join

| Method | Endpoint                         | Description       | কার জন্য |
| ------ | -------------------------------- | ----------------- | -------- |
| POST   | /registrations/pay-join/:eventId | Paid join request | User     |

---

### 📡 Private Request

| Method | Endpoint                        | Description     | কার জন্য |
| ------ | ------------------------------- | --------------- | -------- |
| POST   | /registrations/request/:eventId | Request to join | User     |

---

### 📡 Invitations

| Method | Endpoint                  | Description   | কার জন্য |
| ------ | ------------------------- | ------------- | -------- |
| POST   | /registrations/invite     | Invite user   | Owner    |
| PATCH  | /registrations/accept/:id | Accept invite | User     |
| PATCH  | /registrations/reject/:id | Reject invite | User     |

---

### 📡 Owner Controls

| Method | Endpoint                   | Description         | কার জন্য |
| ------ | -------------------------- | ------------------- | -------- |
| PATCH  | /registrations/approve/:id | Approve participant | Owner    |
| PATCH  | /registrations/reject/:id  | Reject participant  | Owner    |
| PATCH  | /registrations/ban/:id     | Ban user            | Owner    |

---

### 📡 View Participants

| Method | Endpoint                      | Description        | কার জন্য |
| ------ | ----------------------------- | ------------------ | -------- |
| GET    | /registrations/event/:eventId | Event participants | Owner    |
| GET    | /registrations/my             | My registrations   | User     |

---

### ⚙️ Core Logic (IMPORTANT 🔥)

| Event Type   | Flow                        |
| ------------ | --------------------------- |
| Free Public  | Auto APPROVED               |
| Paid Public  | Payment → PENDING           |
| Private Free | Request → PENDING           |
| Private Paid | Payment + Request → PENDING |

---

### ⚠️ Rules

* Duplicate join allowed না
* Banned user rejoin করতে পারবে না
* Payment verify না হলে join valid না

---

## ⭐ 6. Review Module

### 📁 Structure

```
Review/
├── review.controller.ts
├── review.service.ts
├── review.route.ts
└── review.validation.ts
```

### 📡 APIs

| Method | Endpoint                | Description   | কার জন্য |
| ------ | ----------------------- | ------------- | -------- |
| POST   | /reviews                | Create review | User     |
| GET    | /reviews/event/:eventId | Event reviews | Public   |
| PATCH  | /reviews/:id            | Update review | User     |
| DELETE | /reviews/:id            | Delete review | User     |

### ⚙️ Logic

* Only participants review দিতে পারবে
* One user → one review per event

---

## 💳 7. Payment Module

### 📁 Structure

```
Payment/
├── payment.controller.ts
├── payment.service.ts
├── payment.route.ts
└── payment.utils.ts
```

### 📡 APIs

| Method | Endpoint           | Description              | কার জন্য |
| ------ | ------------------ | ------------------------ | -------- |
| POST   | /payments/initiate | Start payment            | User     |
| POST   | /payments/success  | Payment success callback | Gateway  |
| POST   | /payments/fail     | Payment fail callback    | Gateway  |

---

### ⚙️ Payment Flow

1. User → initiate
2. Redirect → gateway
3. Callback আসে
4. Verify করা হয়
5. Registration update

---

