| GET    | /dashboard/my-events   | My events       | User       |
| GET    | /dashboard/invitations | Pending invites | User       |

---

## ⚠️ 9. Validation & Error Handling

### Validation

* Required fields
* Email ঠিক থাকতে হবে
* Fee ≥ 0

### Error Handling

* Global error handler
* Prisma error mapping
* Zod validation error

---

## 🔐 10. Security

* JWT authentication
* Role-based middleware
* Protected routes
* Input sanitization

---

